@startuml
title AI admission | reference and planned boundaries
hide footbox
participant "Caller" as P0
participant "H09" as P1
participant "Provider" as P2
P0 -> P1: begin(now, consent, online)
P1 -> P0: Base: Disabled; no provider call
P1 -> P0: AI without consent: NoConsent
P1 -> P0: AI offline: Offline
P1 -> P2: Eligible AI: start(new ID)
P1 -> P0: Accepted; inspect state for start failure
note over P0: Scenarios include alternatives; read the v2.0 sequence guide for guards.
@enduml
